                    the Foreign Service.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d325-f2" n="2" xml:id="d325-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <ref target="#d324">Document 324</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d325-f3" n="3" xml:id="d325-f3-content">
                <p>The Ad Hoc Women’s Committee held a Department-wide open forum on September 2 to
                    consider recommendations on the status of women for the Task Force Reports, and
                    then forwarded a 16-page proposal for additions and changes to the reports under
                    cover of a September 8 memorandum to Christopher Petrow of Macomber’s office.
                    (National Archives, RG 59, Office of the Deputy Under Secretary for Management,
                    Management Reform Task Force Papers: Lot 74 D 394, Women’s Affairs)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
